git commit -m "Reduce AI/token usage: deterministic-first across all AI features, LLM only for the residual. New deterministic.py resolves country->ISO, currency->ISO, UOM->Oracle code, and Y/N flags via curated maps + fuzzy (no LLM). Value crosswalks resolve known domains deterministically first (a Country/Currency/UOM column now needs zero AI). Source->target mapping runs the rule-based matcher first and only sends low-confidence (<0.60)/unmapped targets to the LLM. Load-error explanations match ~8 common FBDI error patterns statically, AI only for unknown messages. Data-quality AI review only runs to supplement when rule-based checks are sparse (<8). Defaults were already deterministic-first. All paths keep AI as graceful fallback so accuracy holds."
